{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5c47a860-c436-84e0-9b72-b2337bbfa3fe",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:56:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:53:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:53:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Please, I am calling about some trash that was left on the curb. I would like to report it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:53:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. What kind of trash is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:53:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is bulk waste. The landlord of the building next to me, he left it after a tenant moved out. There is a mattress, a chair, and some boxes and a broken lamp."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a mattress, a chair, boxes, and a lamp. And where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:53:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, the location is 389 Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:53:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "389 Kay Street, got it. Is that the building you live in, or the one next door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is the building where the tenant moved out. I am the neighbor. I live in the next house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bear with me one second, I'm typing this in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. No problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, my keyboard is loud today. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I hear you fine. I hear the keyboard also, but it is okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it clacks. Okay, so it's been sitting at the curb since when, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think since Monday evening. The tenant left on Sunday, and the landlord put everything outside the next day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday evening. Alright. And is any of it blocking the sidewalk or the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little bit the sidewalk. People must walk around the mattress."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that it's partly blocking the sidewalk. Anything else I should put down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that is everything. Excuse me, please, can you tell me when is the next pickup on Kay Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me look at the route. [pause] Kay Street is a Friday trash day, so that's tomorrow. But bulk items like a mattress usually need to be scheduled, they don't just go with the regular truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. So the landlord must schedule it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's his responsibility as the property owner. What I can do is send this report so someone from our office follows up with him about removing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. That would be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, let me read it back. Bulk waste at 389 Kay Street, mattress, chair, boxes, and a lamp, left at the curb since Monday, partly on the sidewalk. Reported by a neighbor. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want to leave a callback number, in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0160. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:55:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nicholas Cirelli."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:56:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Cirelli. The report is in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:56:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much for your help. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T12:56:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
